{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ece9b828-400b-4b96-b310-fbba84bcfe3b",
    "name": "Ridgeline · Championship Rewards Boost (E2E)",
    "description": "The ticket, done right: create the boost, check **player-limits** and **geo-compliance** before every offer, claim only for eligible players, place a boosted bet in `stake_minor`, then assert the **end state**: no self-excluded or cool-off player holds a claim. Run in order with the Collection Runner. Each request uses its own service key via a Passport reference.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Create the championship boost",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/promotions/v1/boosts",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "promotions",
            "v1",
            "boosts"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Create a boost on a market. `profit_boost_pct` raises the profit of a winning bet; `rewards_back_pct` credits a share of the stake as rewards when the boosted bet is placed.\n\n**Errors**\n\n| Status | `error` | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 404 | `market_not_found` | Unknown `market_id`. |\n| 401 | `unauthorized` / `unresolved_reference` | Missing or wrong key, or an unresolved Passport reference |",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Championship Rewards Boost\",\n  \"market_id\": \"MKT-ML-001\",\n  \"profit_boost_pct\": 25,\n  \"rewards_back_pct\": 10,\n  \"products\": [\n    \"sportsbook\",\n    \"casino\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{promotions_key}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('boost created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('boost_id', pm.response.json().boost_id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
